          <div class="rs-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <p class="rs-quote">&ldquo;I&rsquo;m in the water and the tall grass on the bank every weekend from April to October. Used to pull a tick off somewhere almost every trip. Since I started the drops? Nothing. Made my wife order a bottle too.&rdquo;</p>
