          <p class="rs-quote">&ldquo;Two people in my circle got diagnosed with Lyme in the last year and a half. I wasn&rsquo;t about to roll the dice with my family. Everyone takes it now. Easy decision, honestly.&rdquo;</p>
          <span class="rs-name">Marcus D.</span>
          <div class="rs-pills"><span>&#10003; Verified Customer</span><span>&#10003; Repeat customer</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rs-card">
        <div class="rs-img"><img src="{{ 'pm-image-vvmabur-75055.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Hiking with a dog" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="573"></div>
        <div class="rs-body">
          <div class="rs-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <p class="rs-quote">&ldquo;We hike with our dog constantly and the tick checks were endless. Now we take the drops and the checks come up clean all summer. Wish we&rsquo;d found it years ago.&rdquo;</p>
          <span class="rs-name">Priya K.</span>
          <div class="rs-pills"><span>&#10003; Verified Customer</span><span>&#10003; Recommends to a friend</span></div>
        </div>
