          <div class="rs-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <p class="rs-quote">&ldquo;Bow season means hours in the timber. A buddy of mine got alpha-gal from a lone star bite &mdash; can&rsquo;t eat red meat anymore. That was all I needed to hear. Two seasons on Pinemoor, zero issues.&rdquo;</p>
